 "items": [
  {
   "s": "am",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "At three in the morning, the mind does arithmetic.",
   "gap": 1.0,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "3:07 AM",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": -90,
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "t": "the mind does arithmetic",
     "c": "i",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": 60,
     "at": 0.45
    }
   ],
   "t0": 1.5,
   "t1": 4.871
  },
  {
   "s": "am",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "How long does a kidney last? How long do I?",
   "gap": 0.9,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "HOW LONG?",
     "c": "a r",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": -20,
     "at": 0.35
    }
   ],
   "t0": 5.963,
   "t1": 9.27
  },
  {
   "s": "am",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "How many names are ahead of mine?",
   "gap": 1.6,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "?",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": -20,
     "at": 0.5
    }
   ],
   "t0": 10.254,
   "t1": 12.558
  },
  {
   "s": "am",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "You were told to be patient. To be compliant. To trust the process.",
   "gap": 0.9,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "PATIENT.",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": -165,
     "at": 0.12
    },
    {
     "t": "COMPLIANT.",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": -15,
     "at": 0.4
    },
    {
     "t": "TRUST THE PROCESS.",
     "c": "a g",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 135,
     "at": 0.68
    }
   ],
   "t0": 14.306,
   "t1": 18.594
  },
  {
   "s": "am",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "So you became a very good patient. You filled out every form. You kept the phone close.",
   "gap": 1.1,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "you kept the phone close",
     "c": "i",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": -20,
     "at": 0.62
    }
   ],
   "t0": 19.577,
   "t1": 25.679
  },
  {
   "s": "am",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "And underneath it all, one quiet question. Is the process thinking about me at all?",
   "gap": 2.4,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "Is the process thinking about me",
     "c": "i",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": -40,
     "at": 0.35
    },
    {
     "t": "AT ALL?",
     "c": "a r",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": 110,
     "at": 0.8
    }
   ],
   "t0": 26.881,
   "t1": 33.195
  },
  {
   "s": "truth",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "Here is what the brochures leave out.",
   "gap": 1.0,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "WHAT THE BROCHURES LEAVE OUT",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 0,
     "at": 0.1
    }
   ],
   "t0": 37.118,
   "t1": 39.785
  },
  {
   "s": "truth",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "Seventeen people die every day waiting for an organ.",
   "gap": 1.3,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "17",
     "c": "x r",
     "pos": "r",
     "y": -60,
     "at": 0.28
    },
    {
     "t": "every day",
     "c": "m",
     "pos": "r",
     "y": 160,
     "at": 0.5
    }
   ],
   "dots": true,
   "t0": 40.877,
   "t1": 44.717
  },
  {
   "s": "truth",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "Not only from disease. From delay. From a form in the wrong stack. From a decision made in a room they were never invited into.",
   "gap": 1.2,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "DELAY.",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": -135,
     "at": 0.22
    },
    {
     "t": "THE WRONG STACK.",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 0,
     "at": 0.42
    },
    {
     "t": "A ROOM THEY WERE NEVER INVITED INTO.",
     "c": "a r",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 135,
     "at": 0.68
    }
   ],
   "t0": 46.138,
   "t1": 55.524
  },
  {
   "s": "truth",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "The rules exist. The conduct does not follow. And almost no one with power is asking why.",
   "gap": 2.2,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "THE RULES EXIST.",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": -80,
     "at": 0.05
    },
    {
     "t": "THE CONDUCT DOES NOT FOLLOW.",
     "c": "a g",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": 50,
     "at": 0.28
    },
    {
     "t": "almost no one is asking why",
     "c": "i",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": 170,
     "at": 0.7
    }
   ],
   "t0": 56.836,
   "t1": 63.79
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "V",
   "text": "I almost didn't come.",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "ELLENTON, FLORIDA  \u00b7  9:40 PM",
     "c": "m",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": -400,
     "at": -0.5
    }
   ],
   "t0": 67.794,
   "t1": 69.309
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "V",
   "text": "I'm tired. I'm sick of being a case number. And I don't know what one person can even do.",
   "gap": 0.9,
   "t0": 70.074,
   "t1": 77.818
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "F",
   "text": "One person is exactly how this started.",
   "gap": 0.8,
   "t0": 78.801,
   "t1": 81.148
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "V",
   "text": "Against all of that?",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "t0": 82.022,
   "t1": 83.558
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "F",
   "text": "Read the page everyone else skimmed. Ask the question nobody wanted asked. Put a name where the system put a number.",
   "gap": 1.0,
   "t0": 84.323,
   "t1": 90.958
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "V",
   "text": "And when they ignore you?",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "t0": 92.051,
   "t1": 93.523
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "F",
   "text": "Then we write it down. Dates. Names. Decisions. A record doesn't get tired. A record doesn't get scared.",
   "gap": 1.0,
   "t0": 94.288,
   "t1": 100.218
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "V",
   "text": "Who pays for this?",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "t0": 101.311,
   "t1": 102.89
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "F",
   "text": "Nobody who profits from the answer. No drug money. No dialysis money. No hospital money. That is the only reason you can trust a word we say.",
   "gap": 1.0,
   "t0": 103.654,
   "t1": 113.105
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "V",
   "text": "That sounds lonely.",
   "gap": 0.9,
   "t0": 114.198,
   "t1": 115.841
  },
  {
   "s": "room",
   "w": "F",
   "text": "It was. Until tonight.",
   "gap": 2.2,
   "t0": 116.824,
   "t1": 118.296
  },
  {
   "s": "legacy",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "Everyone leaves something behind.",
   "gap": 1.0,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "EVERYONE LEAVES SOMETHING BEHIND.",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 0,
     "at": 0.1
    }
   ],
   "t0": 122.1,
   "t1": 124.447
  },
  {
   "s": "legacy",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "A name on a chart. Or a change in the chart.",
   "gap": 1.2,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "A NAME ON A CHART.",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": -60,
     "at": 0.1
    },
    {
     "t": "OR A CHANGE IN IT.",
     "c": "a g",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 70,
     "at": 0.55
    }
   ],
   "t0": 125.539,
   "t1": 128.995
  },
  {
   "s": "legacy",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "You cannot choose how long the clock runs. You can choose what you do while it runs.",
   "gap": 2.2,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "you cannot choose how long",
     "c": "i",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": -90,
     "at": 0.08
    },
    {
     "t": "YOU CAN CHOOSE",
     "c": "a g",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 40,
     "at": 0.55
    },
    {
     "t": "what you do while it runs",
     "c": "i",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 160,
     "at": 0.75
    }
   ],
   "t0": 130.307,
   "t1": 135.981
  },
  {
   "s": "work",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "We investigate what the system hides. We document it. We confront it, in writing, on the record.",
   "gap": 1.0,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "INVESTIGATE",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": -150,
     "at": 0.12
    },
    {
     "t": "DOCUMENT",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": -5,
     "at": 0.35
    },
    {
     "t": "CONFRONT",
     "c": "a r",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 140,
     "at": 0.58
    }
   ],
   "t0": 139.585,
   "t1": 146.583
  },
  {
   "s": "work",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "And we build the tools, free, so no one has to read the fine print alone.",
   "gap": 2.0,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "BUILT FREE.",
     "c": "a g",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": -20,
     "at": 0.3
    },
    {
     "t": "so no one reads the fine print alone",
     "c": "i",
     "pos": "l",
     "y": 110,
     "at": 0.55
    }
   ],
   "t0": 147.675,
   "t1": 152.689
  },
  {
   "s": "close",
   "w": "N",
   "text": "One of the very few truly independent voices in American transplant.",
   "gap": 1.0,
   "big": [
    {
     "t": "TRULY INDEPENDENT.",
     "c": "a",
     "pos": "c",
     "y": 0,
